1
00:00:00,113 --> 00:00:04,243
(Mrs Cooper:)Did I start that sentence with the words
"if it please Your Highness"?

2
00:00:05,952 --> 00:00:08,662
(Sheldon:)I'm not going to.
I didn't say anything that wasn't true.

3
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:10,210
(Mrs Cooper:)Now, you listen here.

4
00:00:10,373 --> 00:00:12,873
I have been telling you since you were 4.

5
00:00:13,043 --> 00:00:17,003
(Mrs Cooper:)It's okay to be smarter than everybody,
but you can't go around pointing it out.

6
00:00:17,172 --> 00:00:19,962
- Why not?
- Because people don't like it.

7
00:00:21,593 --> 00:00:24,093
(Mrs Cooper:)Remember all the ass-kickings
from the neighbor kids?

8
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,850
(Mrs Cooper:)Now, let's get cracking.

9
00:00:29,017 --> 00:00:32,977
(Mrs Cooper:)Shower, shirt, shoes and let's shove off.

10
00:00:34,481 --> 00:00:39,151
(Sheldon:)Wouldn't have been any ass-kickings
if that stupid death ray had worked.

11
00:00:43,406 --> 00:00:45,156
(Mrs Cooper:)Problem solved.

12
00:00:45,325 --> 00:00:47,865
(Leonard:)Really? That's impressive.

13
00:00:48,036 --> 00:00:50,826
(Mrs Cooper:)Leonard, the Lord never gives us
more than we can handle.

14
00:00:50,997 --> 00:00:53,417
(Mrs Cooper:)Thankfully, he blessed me
with two other children...

15
00:00:53,583 --> 00:01:00,023
(Mrs Cooper:)...who are dumb as soup.

